  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SweFOR/Kristna Fredsr&#xf6;relsen Colombia 2022-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SweFOR/Kristna Fredsr&#xf6;relsen Colombia 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projektst&#xf6;d till SweFOR:s skyddsprogram syftar till att influera s&#xe4;kerhetsriskerna f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare genom att: (i) F&#xf6;rhindra hot mot m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare; (ii) Minska m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarares utsatthet; (iii) &#xd6;ka skyddskapaciteten hos f&#xf6;rsvararnas organisationer f&#xf6;r sj&#xe4;lvskydd; och (iv) &#xd6;ka den institutionella reaktionen f&#xf6;r att skydda m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare. SweFOR har tre arbetsomr&#xe5;den f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; dessa m&#xe5;l:

1) Fysisk ledsagning av f&#xf6;rsvarare.
2) &#xd6;ka graden av engagemang hos skyldighetsb&#xe4;rare och nyckelakt&#xf6;rer f&#xf6;r skyddet av m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare.
3) St&#xe4;rka sj&#xe4;lvskyddssystem/mekanismer och kulturen f&#xf6;r icke-v&#xe5;ldsamt och differentierat sj&#xe4;lvskydd.

Detta st&#xf6;d &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; ett tidigare projekt med ID-nummer: 12314.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project support to SweFOR&#x2019;s protection programme aims to influence the security risks of human rights defenders by: (i) Deterring threats to human rights defenders; (ii) Reducing vulnerability conditions of human rights defenders; (iii) Increasing protection capacities of defenders&#x2019; organisations for self-protection; and (iv) Increasing institutional reaction to protect human rights defenders. SweFOR has three working areas through which it will accomplish these goals:

1) Physical accompaniment to defenders.
2) Increasing the level of commitment of duty bearers and key stakeholders in the protection of Human Rights defenders.
3) Strengthen self-protection systems/mechanisms and the culture of non-violent and differentiated self-protection.

This contribution is a continuation of a previous project with ID-number: 12314.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the intervention is To strengthen and advance human rights defenders and organisations processes related to land and environmental protection, the right to a life in peace and the eradication of gender-based violence, impunity and the militarization of civil life, in Colombia.

For achieving this goal, four specific outcomes have been drawn up:

1. Accompanied Human Rights defenders perceive their security, legitimacy and scope of action has broaden, allowing them to organise and foster peace, justice and the construction of a non-violent society processes;
2. Human Rights defenders who participate in security and protection capacity building trainings, have increased their knowledge for timely and sound follow-up and assessments as well as defining proper digital security procedures;
3. Duty bearers listen to human rights defenders demands and timely react to threats and potential risks to ensure defenders&apos; security;
4. Duty bearers have updated and detailed information on human rights defenders situation to provide relevant and timely protection measures, including public statements reinforcing the rights to free expression and association.</narrative>
  </description>
